### All leagues
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leagues

### Create a league
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Serie A", "country": "Italy"}

### Invalid: empty name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "country": "Italy"}

###AllTeams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams

###Create a team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Juventus", "city": "Turin", "leagueId": "4"}

### Invalid: empty name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "country": "Turin"}